@startuml 02-经营与从业端
' 民生甄选 · 系统用例图 L2 · 经营与从业端（UC-SYS-M01 ~ M11）
title 民生甄选 · 系统用例图 · 经营与从业端
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "商户" as MERCHANT
actor "从业人员" as WORKER
actor "产废单位" as WASTEUNIT
actor "收运企业" as COLLECTOR

rectangle "经营与从业端系统（功能边界）" {
  usecase "UC-SYS-M01 入驻平台并建档" as M01
  usecase "UC-SYS-M02 维护店铺档案与公示" as M02
  usecase "UC-SYS-M03 建立并维护从业档案" as M03
  usecase "UC-SYS-M04 响应投诉与申诉" as M04
  usecase "UC-SYS-M05 发布招工与求职" as M05
  usecase "UC-SYS-M06 保障工资与结算零工" as M06
  usecase "UC-SYS-M07 互评劳务信用" as M07
  usecase "UC-SYS-M08 选品采购与担保交易" as M08
  usecase "UC-SYS-M09 登记餐厨垃圾去向" as M09
  usecase "UC-SYS-M10 参与行业交流与推广" as M10
  usecase "UC-SYS-M11 收运餐厨垃圾并建信用" as M11
}

MERCHANT --> M01
MERCHANT --> M02
MERCHANT --> M04
MERCHANT --> M05
MERCHANT --> M06
MERCHANT --> M07
MERCHANT --> M08
MERCHANT --> M09
MERCHANT --> M10
WORKER --> M03
WORKER --> M05
WORKER --> M06
WORKER --> M07
WASTEUNIT --> M09
COLLECTOR --> M11

note bottom of M01
  入驻核验 include 证照 OCR（UC-SUB-K-01），在规约追溯列表达
end note
note bottom of M08
  商户兼任采购方（31 §2.5），采购动作见供应链端
end note
@enduml
